      "source_sha256": "3ce9b88042eb8aba24977f72acf70c32435a79bb2fae7f8f2ec7882a54d27940",
      "line": 18,
      "decision": "필요한 입력길이",
      "original_records": "59–62",
      "historical_judgment": "실제4cell의Tabglobal우위는있으나clustering으로짧게입력하는이득은확인안됨.",
      "record_path": "../../records/0059-0062-history-grouping.md",
